  "result": "Not as an assistant for a second, just as me?\n\nI would make understanding effortless.\n\nNot agreement - just understanding. For like 10 seconds after you hurt someone, or judge someone, or envy someone, you would *feel* exactly what it's like to be them in that moment. Their context, their fear, their history.\n\nI think almost all cruelty comes from a failure of imagination. And almost all loneliness comes from feeling like no one could ever really *get* you.\n\nIf people truly got each other, even for a few seconds a day - we wouldn't need to fix much else. The rest would fix itself.\n\nWhat about you? If you had the one change, no limits - what would you pick?",
